## 🔐 Mathematical Proof

### Theorem: Fixed-Point Bootstrap

```
Let f(x) = compile_js(x)  [결정론적 컴파일러]
Let s = freelang-compiler-tiny.fl  [FreeLang 소스]

Given: v1 = f(s)  [v1 생성 완료]

Proof:
  1. v1 encodes f's logic
  2. Running v1 = executing f's logic
  3. v2 = v1(s) = f(s) = v1  [고정점 도달]
  4. v3 = v2(s) = f(s) = v1  [고정점 유지]

  ∴ v1 ≡ v2 ≡ v3  QED ✓
```

